          "content": "State and limits",
          "sourceFactIds": [
            "mobs"
          ]
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "content": "Agent Runtime Integration and operational authority profiles are approved architecture. Consumer conformity requires its own validation. This case does not claim unrestricted autonomous engineering or commercial adoption.",
